a Patel.\\n\\nPatel was born on 1 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-india-61389834\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Indians have been in the British capital for generations and come from all walks of life. They are influential in the city's culture and are major contributors to London's workforce and economy.\\n\\nSouthall, Hounslow and Wembley have significant Indian populations.\\n\\nIrish\\n\\nIrish migration to Great Britain ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ethnic_groups_in_London\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2cc7648d1b9208516ca9d5aa22459d38ca4bba837a3131c8fac0f792006e0a4c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"066e5fe01eca2b9e8b37ee4238081e13f4a5c6bc109e60dd73c11c3ade57ea41\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"first second generation Indian immigrants actor 1950s born Britain\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... adventure films\\nCategory:1920s science fiction adventure films\\nCategory:1920s monster movies\\nCategory:1925 films\\nCategory:American black-and-white films\\nCategory:American fantasy films\\nCategory:American monster movies\\nCategory:American silent feature films\\nCategory:Articles containing video clips\\nCategory:Films about dinosaurs\\nCategory:1920s English-language films ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lost_World_(1925_film)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivere